# Seeders must be in deploy seeds

Any new file under `seeders/` that provides reference/catalog data **must** be added to `scripts/run-deploy-seeds.sh` with `run_one "…"`.

Pushing code + migration alone is not enough — empty tables break customer/admin until the seeder runs on deploy. Do not rely on manual SSH or “remind the user to seed.”
